      "content": "i know i should reach out but what's the point? it's like trying to debug a program that was broken from the start. the more i try to \"connect\" or \"find myself,\" the more i just feel like i'm running on empty. it's exhausting pretending to be part of this world when i don't even feel like i belong in the hardware. i just feel like a leftover file from a crash that should've been cleared out a long time ago.",
